fix: resolve Gemini search grounding + jsonMode conflict causing source research failures

Google's Generative Language API does not support responseMimeType: 'application/json'
when search grounding tools are enabled — they are mutually exclusive. Now skips jsonMode
when searchGrounding is active (JSON is parsed from text response via extractJSON).

Also fixes incorrect source_research_model attribution: previously used contentResult
(Claude Opus) fallback status to determine source model, which always reported
'gemini-flash' even when Gemini failed. Now tracks actual model used per-phase.